[271]="700479E5\n1\tCompleta 'El espíritu de Yule' cinco veces más\tCada día hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal. ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Risco Invernal y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante cinco días más!\n2\tCompleta 'El espíritu de Yule' (total: 5)\tCada día hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal. ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Risco Invernal y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante cinco días más!\n3\tHabla con Mara Arenales\tMara Arenales desea agradecerle por su continua participación en el Festival de Yule.\n",
[272]="7004C98F\n1\tCompleta 'El espíritu de Yule' tres veces más\t¡Cada día hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal! ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Risco Invernal y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante tres días!'\n2\tCompleta 'El espíritu de Yule' (total: 3)\t¡Cada día hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal! ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Risco Invernal y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante tres días!'\n3\tHabla con Mara Arenales\tMara Arenales desea agradecerle por su continua participación en el Festival de Yule.\n",
[273]="700479E4\n1\tCompleta 'El espíritu de Yule' cinco veces\tCada día hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal. ¡Cada día es Yule! Ven y únete a todos en Risco Invernal y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante cinco días.\n2\tCompleta 'El espíritu de Yule' (total: 5)\tCada día hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal. ¡Cada día es Yule! Ven y únete a todos en Risco Invernal y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante cinco días.\n3\tHabla con Mara Arenales\tMara Arenales desea agradecerle por su continua participación en el Festival de Yule.\n",
[274]="7004C992\n1\tComplete 'In the Spirit of Yule' three times\t¡Cada día hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal! ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Risco Invernal y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante tres días!\n2\tCompleta 'En el espíritu de Yule' (total: 3)\t¡Cada día hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal! ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Risco Invernal y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante tres días!'\n3\tHabla con Mara Arenales\tMara Arenales desea agradecerle por su continua participación en el Festival de Yule.\n",
[275]="7004A389\n1\tConsulta el objetivo de esta etapa en el diario.\t\n2\tAccept surrenders (total: 10)\tAccept the surrender of any Forgeworkers or Men who offer it.\n3\tVisit the Udûn Foothold\tYou should visit the Udûn Foothold to check on the fate of the surrendered peoples.\n",
[276]="700032D7\n1\tLleva las hojas del diario a Wilimar Bolger\030Recoge hojas de diario (total: 3)\tSe pueden encontrar lobos al este de Bolgovado. Sin las hojas faltantes, será imposible determinar quién disparó la flecha en la puerta de Wilimar Bolger, ni por qué. Wilimar sospecha que los lobos destrozaron el diario y te ha pedido que intentes recuperar las hojas de ellos.\n",
[277]="700455DC\n1\tDefeat foes on the Pelennor Fields (total: 30)\tFoes can be found across the Pelennor Fields. Burnoth has asked you to aid in the Battle of the Pelennor Fields by defeating many of the Enemy's forces.\n2\tBattle your way to the centre of the Pelennor Fields\tEnemies are on all sides! Hold the field and protect those you can! You have defeated many of the Enemy's forces and should now continue to aid the forces of Gondor and Rohan on the field. Note: You must complete Book 6, Chapter 2 of Volume IV to advance this objective.\n3\tSearch for the Riders Three at Kings' End\tKings' End can be found near the centre of the Pelennor Fields at the site where Théoden King fell. You have arrived at Kings' End and should now seek out the Riders Three.\n4\tTalk to Ulf at Kings' End\030Talk to Hutha at Kings' End\tBurnoth, Hutha, and Ulf can be found at Kings' End. You have found the Riders Three at Kings' End and should now speak to them.\n5\tPlant Léofdag's spear, Wrecend, in the ground at Kings' End\tA small mound of earth can be found near the site where Théoden King fell at Kings' End. Hutha has asked you to plant Léofdag's spear near the site where Théoden King fell.\n6\tTalk to Burnoth at Kings' End\tBurnoth can be found at Kings' End. You have honoured Léofdag's memory by laying his spear at the site where his King fell. You should now speak to Burnoth.\n",
[278]="7004A81C\n1\tDefeat foes in Dâr Mauzur (total: 12)\030Destroy Orkish barriers in Dâr Mauzur (total: 8)\tBregdal has asked you to defeat foes in Dâr Mauzur and destroy Orkish barriers.\n",
[279]="700250F3\n1\tGo to Mara Sandydowns, for she wishes to speak with you\tMara Sandydowns can be found near the entrance to Winter-home. You should speak with Mara Sandydowns, for everyone says she is looking for you.\n2\tTalk to Mara Sandydowns when you are ready to hear the choice she will ask you to make.\tMara Sandydowns can be found near the entrance to Winter-home. You should speak with Mara Sandydowns, for she is about to present you with an important decision.\n3\tMara Sandydowns can be found near the entrance to Winter-home. She is presenting you with a choice, either help the poor or help the rich of Winter-home.\t\n4\tMara Sandydowns can be found near the entrance to Winter-home. Return and speak to Mara Sandydowns now that you have cast your lot one way or the other.\t\n",
[280]="7007161D\n1\tRescue imprisoned thralls (total: 6)\030Defeat Ordâkhai inside Esh Mêkag prison (total: 15)\030Defeat Warden Khusóku\tA new warden has taken control of Esh Mêkag and is threatening to execute the thralls remaining inside. You should rescue the imprisoned thralls, and defeat the Ordâkhai inside Esh Mêkag prison.\n2\tTalk to Ebuzâm\tThe remaining thralls have been rescued and the new warden defeated. You should return to Ebuzâm.\n",
[281]="70047BD1\n1\tBurn the remains of the slain at Ondoher's Folly (total: 10)\tDefiled remains can be found throughout Ondoher's Folly, in north-western Dagorlad. You have discovered the grim remains of many slain prisoners and slaves at Ondoher's Folly. You should burn them before the Orcs can defile them further.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have burned many of the slain at Ondoher's Folly and prevented the Orcs from further defiling their remains.\n",
[282]="70017509\n1\tDerrota al Guardián del Agua\tEl Guardián del Agua mora en la Fauce Vil. Kaldi te advirtió de que el enemigo que habita en las Fauces Viles es capaz de arrastrar los propios corazones de quienes se le acercan hacia el olvido, si no cuentan con el gran poder de la luz de su lado. Sé cauteloso y ve acompañado de dos comunidades de tus aliados más firmes.\n2\tHabla con Kaldi a las afueras de la Fauce Vil\tKaldi se encuentra en el campamento situado a las afueras de la Fauce Vil. Tu victoria sobre el Guardián del Agua será recordada como un gran triunfo entre los enanos.\n",
[283]="7004956D\n1\tDeliver Gimli's message to the Firehorns at the hidden gate of the Oath-taker's Horn\tThe hidden gate of Lûghash can be found in an alcove high above the main gate, accessible by a rear pathway leading onto the Spire. Gimli has asked you to deliver a message to the Firehorns in the Oath-taker's Horn. He hopes that King Greytooth might be convinced to treat upon the plains of Dor Amarth.\n2\tDeliver Gimli's message to the Firehorns at the main gate of the Oath-taker's Horn\tThe main gate of the Oath-taker's Horn can be found in the vale far below the hidden gate. You have tried to enter the hidden gate and have found that the Firehorns have begun to seal it from within. You should now try the main gate.\n3\tCall forth the Firehorns and deliver Gimli's message\tThe gate mechanism can be found beside the main gate of the Oath-taker's Horn. You have arrived at the main gate of the Oath-taker's Horn. You should use the gate mechanism and call forth the Firehorns to deliver Gimli's message.\n4\tTalk to Gimli outside the Oath-taker's Horn\tGimli can be found along the causeway outside the Oath-taker's Horn. You were brutally attacked by the Firehorns, and they threatened the Dwarves of Durin's Folk. You should talk to Gimli and tell him what has happened.\n",
[284]="7005A802\n1\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found outside Muru Azog at Azanulbizar. After the defeat of Azog and the clearing of Orkish filth from Azanulbizar, King Thráin wishes to honour his father, Thrór. You should talk to King Thráin.\n2\tHabla con el Rey Thráin en Amdân\tKing Thráin can be found at Amdân. After the burning of the dead at Azanulbizar, King Thráin and the survivors of the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs have returned to Amdân. You should talk to King Thráin.\n3\tHabla con Dáin Ironfoot\tDáin can be found at Amdân. After the burning of the dead at Azanulbizar, King Thráin and the survivors of the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs have returned to Amdân. You should talk to Dáin.\n",
[285]="7000D7FD\n1\tRecoge tantas flores como puedas en una hora\tHay multitud de violetas en las Tierras de Bree. Hay multitud de prímulas en Ered Luin. Hay multitud de caléndulas en la Comarca. Gredlan Artemisa está en Bree. Avery Manzanagria te ha pedido recolectar flores por las Tierras de Bree, Ered Luin y la Comarca, y entregárselas a Gredlan Artemisa.\n",
[286]="70000050\n1\tLleva carne de lince al Viejo Artemisa\030Recolecta carne de lince (total: 8)\tSe pueden encontrar linces en todo Nain Enidh -- el centro de las Tierras Solitarias -- al norte y noreste del campamento en el extremo este de Minas Eriol. El Viejo Artemisa cree que ha encontrado una forma de expulsar a los trasgos y huargos de las Tierras Solitarias, pero primero necesita que recojas carne de lince.\n",
[287]="700381C5\n1\tAyuda a Gimli y a sus aliados a completar su patrulla ([según el diario]/4)\tAyuda a Gimli a eliminar las amenazas enemigas que han logrado flanquear a los defensores en el muro, mientras otros trabajan para rescatar suministros de las estructuras sitiadas dentro del profundo. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n",
[288]="7005AB02\n1\tDefeat Héormuth\tNáth has told you about a huge white sabre-cat lurking somewhere near Fellgát. You should find and defeat the sabre-cat known as Héormuth.\n2\tTalk to Náth in Fellgát\tYou have successfully defeated the sabre-cat menacing the dwarves in Fellgát. You should talk to Náth.\n",
})
